/v1/","context":{"app_id":4734180,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4734180-1847286114033423","game_id":"steam-4734180","kind":"update","title":"Oct 22 Patch notes + What's next for Echoes of Aromia?","summary":"Here's all the changes for the demo this week. This update shouldn't break anyone's saves. But just to be cautious i recommend anyone who is interested in trying out the new content to start a new save. Major changes: - The time system has been changed. NPCs no longer go to sleep, and shops no longer close for the night. This has become something that ended up being more annoying to players than something that actually contributed to the dynamic-ness of the world, So I've made the decision to st","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:34:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033423","verified_at":"2026-10-22T21:52:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4734180-1845383656394910","game_id":"steam-4734180","kind":"update","title":"Echoes of Aromia Demo - Oct 5 Patch notes","summary":"Here's all the changes for the demo this week. This update shouldn't break anyone's saves. But just to be cautious i recommend anyone who is interested in trying out the new content to start a new save. Major changes: - A long requested feature is here: Map markers! You can now see on the local map where you need to go in order to do your quests. This should help reduce a lot of frustration and ''lost-ness'' i've been seeing with some playtesters. Folks who dislike the handholding this causes ar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T00:02:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394910","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4734180-1844751498228136","game_id":"steam-4734180","kind":"update","title":"Echoes of Aromia Demo - Content update patch notes","summary":"I hope everyone's having a good weekend! Here's all the changes for the demo this week. This update shouldn't break anyone's saves. But just to be cautious i recommend anyone who is interested in trying out the new content to start a new save. Major changes: - Added a new way to start the raider quest ''THOSEWHOSATDOWN''. Walking directly into the raider camp no longer triggers the fight, instead players now have the chance to talk their way out (or in) before being attacked, if they truly wish ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T21:56:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228136","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4734180-1843481262702841","game_id":"steam-4734180","kind":"announcement","title":"Echoes of Aromia - Demo out now!","summary":"We're proud to announce the release of the demo for Echoes of Aromia! I want to say a huge thanks for everyone who has supported us, all the artists, volunteers, playtesters, everyone has donated their time, and helped put their heart and soul into this project, it would not be here without your help. I hope you all enjoy the demo, it has been the culmination of a year of work. Thank you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T19:57:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702841","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4734180-1839676055895588","game_id":"steam-4734180","kind":"announcement","title":"Echoes of Aromia Playtest is now live!","summary":"Hey everyone! First time sending out one of these community announcements through steam.I just wanted to say, the playtest page has just been approved and is now live! So if you've been meaning to try out the game, and playtest, and help me shape the game, now is your chance!All you gotta do is head over to the steam page, and click that ''Join the Playtest'' Button!I'm excited to hear all your feedback, You can send any feedback into the community hub, or reach out directly at Nighttarga@gmail.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T18:41:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895588","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4734180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:01:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:01:03Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4734180":"2026-10-26T04:01:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4734180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:01:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:01:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5022150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:01:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:01:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4734180","app_id":4734180,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:54Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7385f38d9c74ec92026c47f85824a919e01181193147bcc54e912519dadaa177","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Echoes of Aromia is a story-driven, pixel art RPG with turnbased combat, branching dialogue, alchemy, companions, and much more. Set in a pre-steampunk medieval fantasy world on the brink of industrialization, full of corruption, conspiracy, good, and evil. And ancient myths waiting to be uncovered.","publishers":[{"name":"Studio Targa"}],"developers":[{"name":"Studio Targa"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Demo release Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791678296","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4734180/204173218/d7b1c0fbe1b607f0c7d1f276eeb4b4e108a0dd58/1791577028/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4734180/204173218/d7b1c0fbe1b607f0c7d1f276eeb4b4e108a0dd58/1791577028/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4734180/204173218/d7b1c0fbe1b607f0c7d1f276eeb4b4e108a0dd58/1791577028/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4734180/204173218/d7b1c0fbe1b607f0c7d1f276eeb4b4e108a0dd58/1791577028/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4734180/204173218/d7b1c0fbe1b607f0c7d1f276eeb4b4e108a0dd58/1791577028/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257454789/e59a66f350c5387751961a87a23e30a12d355621/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257454789/e59a66f350c5387751961a87a23e30a12d355621/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1373407,"all_ages":true}]}},"field_present":{"basic_info":true,"release":true,"trailers":true},"field_status":{"basic_info":"ok","release":"ok","trailers":"ok"},"field_errors":{},"developers":["Studio Targa"],"publishers":["Studio Targa"],"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Demo release Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791678296","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4734180/204173218/d7